/* 全局设计系统：赛博皮影 · NEON SHADOW
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
   上一版走"漆木 + 鎏金"的暖色民俗路线。问题不在细节，而在整体明度太低、
   所有元素挤在同一个棕色系里，扫一眼找不到焦点，像旧柜台不像游戏。
   这一版把整套语汇换掉：
   1) 底色压到近黑（#04060C），只用三支霓虹：激光青 / 电光洋红 / 酸性黄绿。
      靠极高对比度做"屏幕在发光"的第一眼冲击，而不是靠更多装饰。
   2) 所有面改为「黑玻璃 + 1rpx 霓虹细边 + 角标刻度」的 HUD 结构，
      层级靠亮度与发光强度区分，不再靠色块堆叠。
   3) 大标题 900 字重 + 双色错位故障层；牌面改成暗场全息卡，点数自带辉光。
      牌本身成为发光物，而不是贴在桌上的纸片。
   4) 动效只留三处（按钮扫光 / 牌桌光环旋转 / 标题偶发故障），少而狠，
      避免全屏乱动在低端机上掉帧。
   概念上仍是陕北：皮影的剪影、腰鼓的节拍，被翻译成霓虹灯管与 HUD 刻度。 */

/* 变量同时声明在 page 与 .page 两个选择器上。
   [FIX 2026-11-19] 单一 page 规则一旦被整体丢弃（例如其中某个声明让 WXSS 的 rpx
   运行时替换失败），所有 var(--x) 会同时失效 —— 文字退回默认黑色，在近黑底上等于隐身，
   表现就是「页面在、什么都没有」。双份声明让这条链路有冗余。 */
page,
.page {
  /* --- 新色板 --- */
  --void: #04060C;
  --void-2: #080E1A;
  --glass-hi: rgba(18, 30, 50, 0.90);
  --glass-lo: rgba(6, 10, 20, 0.94);
  --cyan: #2CF2FF;
  --cyan-deep: #0C93A8;
  --magenta: #FF2D7A;
  --acid: #C9FF24;
  --violet: #7A5CFF;
  --ink: #E9F5FF;
  --ink-2: #7E96AD;
  --ink-3: #46596D;
  --jade: #35E6A8;
  /* --- 兼容旧页面的变量名（规则/统计/设置/隐私仍引用），值全部指向霓虹色 --- */
  --gold: #2CF2FF;
  --gold-2: #0C93A8;
  --gold-dim: #6E879E;
  --paper: #0B1220;
  --red: #FF2D7A;
  --red-2: #FF6FA3;
  --bg-deep: #04060C;
  --bg-deep-2: #080E1A;
  --bg-panel: #0B1220;
  --bg-panel-2: #131E33;
}

page {
  background-color: var(--void);
  /* 三层：顶部洋红雾、左上青光、底部青辉，最后压一层竖向渐变。
     [FIX 2026-11-19] 这里原来还有两层 1rpx 的 repeating-linear-gradient 网格，已移除：
     渐变函数里写 rpx 依赖 WXSS 运行时的文本替换，一旦替换失败，整条 page 规则
     （连同全部 CSS 变量）会被丢弃，所有 var(--ink) 文字退回默认黑色 —— 页面看起来就是空的。 */
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(96% 42% at 50% -10%, rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.30) 0%, rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.06) 46%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 74%),
    radial-gradient(58% 30% at 4% 2%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.18) 0%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0) 68%),
    radial-gradient(92% 40% at 50% 108%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.20) 0%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0) 70%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #0A1122 0%, #05070E 56%, #03050A 100%);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: "PingFang SC", "HarmonyOS Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

.page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx calc(52rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

/* ---------- 黑玻璃 HUD 面板 ---------- */
.panel {
  position: relative;
  background-image: linear-gradient(152deg, var(--glass-hi) 0%, rgba(10, 17, 30, 0.92) 58%, var(--glass-lo) 100%);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.16);
  border-radius: 6rpx;
  padding: 30rpx 28rpx;
  margin-bottom: 22rpx;
  box-shadow:
    0 18rpx 44rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.58),
    inset 0 1rpx 0 rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.16),
    inset 0 0 40rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.04);
  overflow: hidden;
}
/* 上沿一道发光的扫描线：告诉眼睛"这是一块屏"，而不是一块纸 */
.panel::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; top: 0;
  width: 44%; height: 2rpx;
  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan) 0%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.35) 42%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0) 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 14rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.85);
}
/* 右下角洋红刻度角标 */
.panel::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  right: 12rpx; bottom: 12rpx;
  width: 26rpx; height: 26rpx;
  border-right: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.55);
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.55);
}

.panel-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 4rpx;
  color: var(--cyan);
  margin-bottom: 22rpx;
  text-shadow: 0 0 16rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.45);
}
.panel-title::before {
  content: '';
  width: 4rpx; height: 24rpx;
  margin-right: 14rpx;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  background: var(--magenta);
  box-shadow: 0 0 12rpx rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.9);
}
/* 标题右侧延伸的细线，把标题变成一条 HUD 分隔 */
.panel-title::after {
  content: '';
  flex: 1;
  height: 1rpx;
  margin-left: 18rpx;
  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.40) 0%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0) 100%);
}

/* ---------- 主按钮：酸性渐变 + 扫光 ---------- */
.btn {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  height: 100rpx;
  border-radius: 4rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  background-image: linear-gradient(100deg, #D9FF45 0%, #8CFF9E 42%, #2CF2FF 100%);
  color: #04121A;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 5rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  border: none;
  box-shadow:
    0 14rpx 34rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.26),
    0 0 30rpx rgba(201, 255, 36, 0.16),
    inset 0 2rpx 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55),
    inset 0 -6rpx 16rpx rgba(0, 80, 90, 0.22);
  transition: transform 120ms ease, box-shadow 120ms ease;
}
.btn::after { border: none; }
/* 一道斜向扫光缓慢掠过：整屏唯一的"高光时刻"，让按钮看起来是通电的 */
.btn::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -10%; left: -45%;
  width: 32%; height: 120%;
  background-image: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%);
  transform: skewX(-20deg);
  animation: btnSheen 4.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes btnSheen {
  0%, 62% { left: -45%; }
  86%, 100% { left: 118%; }
}
.btn.button-hover {
  transform: translateY(3rpx) scale(0.988);
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 12rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.24), inset 0 2rpx 10rpx rgba(0, 40, 50, 0.35);
}
.btn[disabled] {
  background-image: none;
  background-color: rgba(28, 40, 56, 0.55);
  color: rgba(126, 150, 173, 0.45);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.10);
}
.btn[disabled]::before { display: none; }

/* ---------- 次键：霓虹灯管描边 ---------- */
.btn-outline {
  background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.13) 0%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.02) 100%);
  color: var(--cyan);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.46);
  letter-spacing: 3rpx;
  box-shadow:
    inset 0 0 26rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.10),
    0 10rpx 24rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
}
.btn-outline::before { display: none; }
.btn-outline.button-hover {
  transform: translateY(2rpx);
  background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.24) 0%, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.08) 100%);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 30rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.22), 0 0 22rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.22);
}
.btn-outline[disabled] {
  border-color: rgba(126, 150, 173, 0.18);
  color: rgba(126, 150, 173, 0.34);
  background-image: none;
  box-shadow: none;
}
.btn-block { width: 100%; }

/* ---------- 分段选择：通电的胶囊 ---------- */
.pill-group {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8rpx;
  padding: 6rpx;
  border-radius: 6rpx;
  background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.50) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 100%);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.14);
  box-shadow: inset 0 3rpx 10rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
}
.pill {
  flex: 1;
  height: 64rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: 4rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--ink-2);
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  transition: color 120ms ease, background 120ms ease;
}
.pill.on {
  background-image: linear-gradient(118deg, #FF2D7A 0%, #FF6A3D 100%);
  color: #1A0310;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-shadow: none;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 22rpx rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.55),
    inset 0 1rpx 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
}

/* 兼容旧页面（规则/统计/设置仍在用 segmented） */
.segmented { display: flex; border: 1rpx solid rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.28); border-radius: 4rpx; overflow: hidden; }
.segmented .seg {
  flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 18rpx 0; font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--ink-2); background: transparent;
  border-right: 1rpx solid rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.16);
}
.segmented .seg:last-child { border-right: none; }
.segmented .seg.on { background: var(--cyan); color: #04121A; font-weight: 700; }

/* ---------- 牌面：暗场全息卡 ---------- */
.card {
  position: relative;
  width: 100rpx;
  height: 142rpx;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  overflow: hidden;
  background-color: #0A1120;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(158deg, rgba(38, 60, 88, 0.96) 0%, rgba(13, 22, 38, 0.98) 54%, rgba(6, 10, 18, 0.99) 100%);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.32);
  box-shadow:
    0 8rpx 20rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62),
    inset 0 0 26rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.13),
    inset 0 1rpx 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
}
/* 斜向冷光：模拟全息卡箔的反射，让牌面有"材质"而不是纯色块 */
.card::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -25%; left: -35%;
  width: 58%; height: 150%;
  background-image: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 72%);
  transform: rotate(9deg);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.card-rank {
  position: absolute;
  left: 8rpx; top: 6rpx;
  font-size: 38rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -1rpx;
  font-family: "DIN Alternate", "Helvetica Neue", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
  z-index: 1;
}
.card-suit {
  position: absolute;
  left: 9rpx; top: 50rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 1;
  opacity: 0.95;
  z-index: 1;
}
/* 右下角一枚 L 形刻度：替代原来的大面积花色暗纹。
   暗底上大色块会糊成灰斑，而细线刻度既能提示"这是张牌"，又不抢点数的注意力。 */
.card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  right: 8rpx; bottom: 8rpx;
  width: 14rpx; height: 14rpx;
  border-right: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
  z-index: 1;
}
.card.red::before { border-color: rgba(255, 61, 134, 0.55); }
.card.black::before { border-color: rgba(191, 244, 255, 0.45); }
.card.red { color: #FF3D86; }
.card.red .card-rank { text-shadow: 0 0 14rpx rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.85); }
.card.red .card-suit { text-shadow: 0 0 10rpx rgba(255, 45, 122, 0.7); }
.card.black { color: #BFF4FF; }
.card.black .card-rank { text-shadow: 0 0 14rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.80); }
.card.black .card-suit { text-shadow: 0 0 10rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.65); }

/* ---------- 文本 ---------- */
.muted { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 24rpx; }
.center { text-align: center; }
.row-label {
  font-size: 21rpx; color: var(--ink-2);
  margin: 18rpx 0 10rpx; letter-spacing: 3rpx;
}

/* ---------- 遮罩 ---------- */
.mask {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 40rpx;
  background: rgba(2, 4, 9, 0.90);
}
.mask-card {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 600rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 46rpx 34rpx 34rpx;
  border-radius: 6rpx;
  background-image: linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(20, 34, 56, 0.98) 0%, rgba(6, 10, 20, 0.99) 100%);
  border: 1rpx solid rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.40);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 60rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.16),
    0 28rpx 70rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72),
    inset 0 1rpx 0 rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.35);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.mask-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; top: 0; right: 0;
  height: 2rpx;
  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 242, 255, 0) 0%, var(--cyan) 30%, var(--magenta) 70%, rgba(255, 45, 122, 0) 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 16rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.8);
}
.mask-title {
  font-size: 38rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 4rpx;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
  text-shadow: 0 0 24rpx rgba(44, 242, 255, 0.55);
}

/* ---------- 大字模式 ---------- */
.large-font .card-rank { font-size: 46rpx !important; }
.large-font .card-suit { font-size: 32rpx !important; }
.large-font .rule-p { font-size: 32rpx !important; }
.large-font .panel-title { font-size: 34rpx !important; }
.large-font .setting-name { font-size: 32rpx !important; }
.large-font .setting-desc { font-size: 26rpx !important; }
.large-font .stat-num { font-size: 46rpx !important; }
.large-font .list-main { font-size: 30rpx !important; }
.large-font .result-title { font-size: 50rpx !important; }
.large-font .score-name { font-size: 32rpx !important; }
.large-font .status-line { font-size: 30rpx !important; }
.large-font .nav-label { font-size: 28rpx !important; }
.large-font .btn { font-size: 32rpx !important; }
